LANTERN KNIGHT — MODULAR UI KIT

21 production PNG layers/masks; nine assembled 24 fps state animations; one standalone illustrated 8-pose flame loop at 8 fps. Animation metadata, PNG frames and atlases included. Native generated artwork is in the separate sources package.

VESSELS
All layers use a 1254×1254 canvas; scale uniformly. Stack optional backing, clipped health/mana fill, optional glass tint, independent highlights, bezel, native runtime text. Use vessel_mask. Fill y = 927 - 645 * clamp(value/max,0,1). This means visible aperture HEIGHT, not circular area. Keep text out of sprites. Blank plate placement and anchors are in ui_metadata.json.

CHARGE
Housing canvas 1024×1536. Fill window [433,465,157,683], bottom-to-top. When full, optionally play charge_flame_overlay at 8 fps. It has eight illustrated poses, 256×512 frames, pivot [.5,.8984375], 4×2 atlas. Place at [392,500,240,720] and clip to charge_mask before the housing.

PANELS / SLOTS
panel_9slice is 1468×640, source insets 160 pixels each side. Preserve corners, stretch only middle edge strips, leave center transparent. Display border width can be smaller (e.g. 35 CSS px); minimum source-coordinate panel size 320×320. Reward ornament is a separate top-center child. Ability bezel is uniformly scaled, not 9-sliced. Runtime icon/text/cooldown goes behind/above the relevant layers. Menu, tooltip, reward and status frames share the same border system.

MOTION
Idle, low-health and charge-ready loop. Deplete, refill, selection, reward, cooldown and activation are one-shot. Nine state animations are assembled from modular illustrated art using fill/opacity/scale/slide changes. The standalone flame loop has eight illustrated poses; activation uses an illustrated corner-spark overlay with a mechanical opacity envelope.

State atlases: six columns, 320×320 frames; exact rectangles in JSON. Add 2–4px padding/extrusion when repacking for filtered game atlases. Clamp texture edges; no repeat. PNGs use straight alpha; art in sRGB, masks linear. Registered canvases must not be tightly recropped independently. No engine project was changed.

RESPONSIVE DEMO
Open index.html with the folders beside it. Flexible grid, live health/mana/charge sliders, editable text, resizable panel. It imposes no fixed full-screen HUD. Demo JavaScript syntax was checked, but browser runtime testing was blocked in the build environment; test it and engine import in your target runtime.

REDUCED MOTION
Use static/ examples or freeze effects at a stable frame. Keep functional live values and native text updating. Disable wave, pulse, sparks, and animated embers; use a steady fill/ready state. The supplied static frames are examples, not fixed values required by gameplay.
